    "status": "present",
    "value": "Update only an owned copy of the second array and count cross-array index pairs whose values sum to a requested total. The approach is: frequency map of mutable owned second array; scan the smaller first array for complements. Its target cost is add expected O(1), count O(n1), O(n1+n2) space. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
